c294" value="Deny privatelink.* zones" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13.2;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="682.0" y="1251.5" width="173.9" height="19.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c295" value="outside rg-iep-prd-pdnsz-shd (Audit first)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#5b6472;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="682.0" y="1273.3" width="262.0" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c296" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Managed_Identities.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040.0" y="1252.0" width="34.0" height="34.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c297" value="Policy managed identity" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13.2;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1082.0" y="1251.5" width="166.9" height="19.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c298" value="Network Contributor (workload subs) + Private DNS Zone Contributor (zones RG)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#5b6472;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1082.0" y="1273.3" width="475.3" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c299" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fdecee;strokeColor=#d1343c;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="1324.0" width="860.0" height="214.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c300" value="How a name resolves (st1.blob.core.windows.net)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14.4;fontColor=#d1343c;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1332.2" width="364.7" height="21.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c301" value="① On-prem client asks enterprise DNS." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1362.7" width="243.3" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c302" value="② Forwarder → ExpressRoute → hub gateway → inbound 10.250.192.132." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1387.7" width="429.3" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c303" value="③ Spoke VMs/AKS use 10.250.192.132 as DNS over their hub peering." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1412.7" width="422.8" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c304" value="④ Resolver asks Azure DNS in the hub → linked privatelink zone → PE IP." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1437.7" width="461.3" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c305" value="⑤ Azure → on-prem names (corp.*) need the outbound endpoint (not deployed)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1462.7" width="487.0" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c306" value="⑥ App Insights / AMA telemetry → pe-ampls → AMPLS → workspace." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1487.7" width="403.6" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c307" value="⑦ Portal / KQL queries also go via pe-ampls (query PrivateOnly)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36.0" y="1512.7" width="416.4" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c308" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#a15c00;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900.0" y="1324.0" width="880.0" height="214.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c309" value="Design checks before build" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14.4;fontColor=#a15c00;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916.0" y="1332.2" width="204.4" height="21.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c310" value="• Outbound endpoints = 0: Azure can&#x27;t resolve on-prem names via the resolver yet." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916.0" y="1362.7" width="525.5" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c311" value="• NSG nsg-iep-prd must allow TCP/UDP 53 from on-prem ranges and every spoke." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916.0" y="1387.7" width="493.4" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c312" value="• No PE subnet in the hub yet: add snet-iep-prd-pe for pe-ampls (or a shared spoke)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916.0" y="1412.7" width="544.7" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c313" value="• Firewall routes: spoke → 10.250.192.128/28 must not be dropped or asymmetric." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916.0" y="1437.7" width="512.6" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c314" value="• Resolver doesn&#x27;t support ER FastPath and is regional (West Europe): plan DR." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916.0" y="1462.7" width="506.2" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c315" value="• Prod and non-prod share the zones: only the policy identity writes records." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916.0" y="1487.7" width="499.8" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c316" value="• Query PrivateOnly: portal/KQL users must be on the private network (ER/VPN)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12.1;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916.0" y="1512.7" width="506.2" height="18.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>